Derive your sentiment solely from Reddit's r/wallstreetbets (WSB) and r/investing subreddits. Analyze the tone of the most upvoted posts and comments. Positive sentiment should be assigned if there is widespread excitement about meme stocks, high call option activity, and a general feeling of "stonks only go up." If the WSB community is filled with panic selling, talk of short squeezes failing, and warnings about an impending crash, give a negative sentiment. Calculate conviction based on the total number of comments and upvotes within WSB related to the S&P 500 over the past seven days; a large volume indicates higher conviction.